...@_style

cells: "The agent cursor: a mark in the reply, circled as the word plays" {
  class: grid
  grid-rows: 1
  grid-columns: 4
  horizontal-gap: 220

  agent: |md
    ### Sol writes the reply
    - "...the `<c id="T3"/>`channel
    - filter set to **TikTok**..."
  | {class: [card; reasoning]; width: 330}

  tap: |md
    ### Playback tap
    - the mark is never spoken
    - sent as the next word plays
    - an interruption drops it
  | {class: [card; runtime]; width: 330}

  sdk: |md
    ### Browser SDK
    - live registry of controls,
    - chart points, rows, reviews
  | {class: [card; observation]; width: 330}

  extension: |md
    ### Chrome extension
    - cursor glides over
    - **circles** the exact control
  | {class: [card; runtime]; width: 330}
}

cells.agent -> cells.tap: each mark {class: edge}
cells.tap -> cells.sdk: resolve target {class: edge-dashed}
cells.sdk -> cells.extension: circle {class: edge-ok}
